## 🌍 INTERACTIVE 3D EARTH MODEL
### Exploring Global Freshwater Resources

As part of AQUAVEIN-SAR, we developed an interactive, rotating 3D Earth model that allows users to explore the locations and geographical distribution of freshwater resources around the world.

The model provides a global perspective on freshwater reservoirs, including groundwater resources, lakes, rivers, and glaciers. By presenting these locations on a rotating digital globe, we make geographical information more accessible and easier to explore.

This feature supports the scientific focus of our project by connecting global freshwater resources with our research on Submarine Groundwater Discharge (SGD) and the relationship between coastal groundwater systems and oceans.

Through this interactive model, users can discover the importance of freshwater distribution and better understand the geographical dimension of Earth's water resources.
